[h2]Build 0.9.9[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]Belt junction[/b] (needs Vanilla Furniture Expanded - Factory): splits one supply belt between several machines. Point the supply belt at the junction and run belts from its other sides to a conveyor arm Feeder at each machine.
[*]Loaders on the supply belt send what all those machines still lack, and the junction passes each item to the machine that wants it.
[*]Feeders have a junction priority (low, normal, high): higher priority gets first claim on the supply, and equal priorities take turns.
[*]Anything no machine wants any more is set down beside the junction, so the supply belt never jams.
[/list]
